# ---- Never commit signing material or credentials --------------------------
# This repo is PUBLIC. sync-game.sh copies index.html in from the sibling
# "Hikmat Games" folder, which also holds the Play upload keystore, its
# passwords, and the publisher's home address and phone. None of that belongs
# here. These patterns are a backstop against an accidental copy.
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.pfx
*.pem
*.key
keystore/
keystore.properties*
KEYSTORE-CREDENTIALS*.txt
*.aab
*.apk
.env
.env.*
